Cell[TextData[{
 "We run the optimisation problem for different values of the affinity of the \
consumer ",
 StyleBox["B",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". After obtaining the results, we normalise the growth rate relative to the \
point where the switch from mode 2 to mode 1 for facultative syntrophy occurs."
}], "Text",
