Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Model and results for resource allocation over mixed strategies \
\>", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.981513625717708*^9, {4.000628780363429*^9, 4.0006288077466497`*^9}, {
   4.0006289030399218`*^9, 
   4.0006289081630707`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"69a97de8-a8d8-4b25-805f-\
0129ed1524f8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "To model resource allocation over mixed strategies in both populations, we \
need to make sure that we simulate the model in the regime where a \
combination of both modes is the optimal strategy. By increasing the S \
concentration to 0.5 mM, we are in this regime. Furthermore, we decrease ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["P", "2"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "f6fe9179-83b0-4ccc-bbda-2530208a4afa"],
 " such that the product inhibition of both modes is comparable. In this \
regime, the model exhibits a gradual shift instead of a discrete switch \
between both modes."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.000789017189386*^9, 4.000789129630391*^9}, {
  4.0007891697022743`*^9, 
  4.000789194300251*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d7e3125e-8f9e-4be2-b919-\
4d1467b5a4e9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

