Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Model and results for division of labour", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.981513625717708*^9, {4.000628780363429*^9, 4.0006288077466497`*^9}, {
   4.000628970244293*^9, 
   4.000628971801077*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"56c73d34-20ea-49c3-b4e6-\
ed4281d8f230"],

Cell["\<\
To model division of labour we extend the reaction network from the previous \
models to larger catabolic pathways. We run the corresponding optimisation \
problems both as function of the substrate concentration S and as function of \
the affinity of the consumer. In both cases, this requires the definition of \
new rate equations and a corresponding extended set of parameters. For more \
details, see the Supplementary Appendices.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.00079018086451*^9, 4.0007902027735577`*^9}, {
  4.000790290328292*^9, 4.000790346996736*^9}, {4.000790400302791*^9, 
  4.000790478872861*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2a71ac5a-8596-4ba2-a08e-\
7e27ae95f500"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Division of labour as function of substrate concentration S", \
"Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990519125053755*^9, 3.990519145163093*^9}, {
  4.000628977672903*^9, 
  4.000628997071423*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2bd70c90-280b-4c29-8530-\
ebd933347b4e"],

