Cell["\<\
We run the optimisation problem for different values of the affinity of the \
consumer. After obtaining the results, we normalise the S concentration and \
the growth rate relative to the point where the shift from mode 2 to mode 1 \
initiates.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.966609191933302*^9, 3.966609192394507*^9}, {
